----------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Case 2: a recycle deferred by a primary reader.  The first VACUUM marks
-- the segment but cannot recycle it while a primary reader still needs
-- it, so the standby reader survives that VACUUM; the second VACUUM,
-- after the primary reader is gone, recycles and cancels the standby
-- reader, whose snapshot predates the marking transaction.
----------------------------------------------------------------------
1: insert into hs_ao_recycle_@amname@ select i, i from generate_series(1, 30) i;
INSERT 0 30
