-- Case 6: the recycled segment is refilled straight away.  Without the
-- conflict record a reader that survived the recycle would read the new
-- rows at the old offsets as if they belonged to its snapshot; the reader
-- must be cancelled while replay catches up, never returning rows.
----------------------------------------------------------------------
